
# ── PAYOUT PROVIDER (flow 2 — the agency pays its PRs) ───────────────────────
# ALL OPTIONAL. The bank-file export path works fully without them; the payout
# screen simply shows "API payouts not configured", which is a normal state.
#
# ⚠️ SINGLE-ACCOUNT FALLBACK ONLY. Per-agency credentials live on
# `agency_payout_account` (migration 0143) and take precedence — an agency must
# pay from an account IT owns. One shared key paying many agencies' PRs would
# make InnocenZ the payer of third-party funds (FSA 2013 / MSBA 2011).
#
# ⚠️ Naming a provider with no registered adapter THROWS on use, deliberately.
# Implement PayoutProvider, register it, and make a real sandbox call BEFORE
# setting these anywhere.
PAYOUT_PROVIDER=
PAYOUT_API_KEY=
PAYOUT_API_SECRET=
PAYOUT_ACCOUNT_ID=
